/E (Through this background guide, we aim to provide you with a foundation to understand the legal frameworks, case studies, regional practices, and thematic concerns central to this discussion. However, it is you, the delegates, who will bring these issues to life. We encourage you to go beyond theory, to negotiate with both conviction and compromise, and to draft resolutions that are ambitious yet grounded in international law and humanitarian principles.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [6]
>>
