244 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The United Nations Multidimensional Integrated Stabilization Mission in the Central African Republic \(MINUSCA\), established in 2014, reflects an adaptive approach to these realities. Its mandate extends beyond traditional peacekeeping to include strong operations against factions refusing to join peace processes, alongside support for political reconciliation, institution-building, and civilian protection. This integrated strategy combines elements of peace enforcement with long-term capacity-building, seeking to balance immediate security concerns with the gradual restoration of state authority.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
