262 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The AU itself has also deployed peace operations, such as the African Union Mission in Somalia \(AMISOM\) and later the African Union Transition Mission in Somalia \(ATMIS\), which were mandated to combat armed groups while simultaneously supporting national institutions and protecting civilians)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
