275 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Engagement strategies with armed groups that recruit children must carefully balance accountability with practical imperatives. On the one hand, perpetrators must not enjoy impunity for grave violations; on the other, humanitarian actors often require dialogue with these groups to negotiate the safe release of children and guarantee access for child protection services. This dual approach reflects the complexity of implementing justice while prioritizing the immediate safety and welfare of children.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
