/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The UN Human Rights Council and various special procedures have increasingly addressed violations by non-state actors, particularly when these groups control territory and exercise governmental-like authority. This pragmatic approach recognizes that civilians under the control of non-state groups deserve protection regardless of the legal status of their de facto authorities. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
