/E (High risk of attacks in conflict zones; armed non-state groups may attack civilians or peacekeepers. Negotiating safe passage is difficult. Poor coordination can escalate the harm and cause gaps in protection. Peacekeepers have restricted authority when it comes to the use of force. They have to act within their mandates, therefore limiting what they can do against armed groups.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [15]
>>
